  "description": "An unexpected ghostly romance. \n\nJae-Hee, who has been able to see ghosts his entire life, will do anything for money. So he doesn't miss an opportunity when he hears of Cheo-Yong, the ghost able to grant any and all sorts of fortunes. Instead, what he finds is a sleepwalking girl possessed by Cheo-Yong... What is this all about?\n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: Includes 1 extra chapter.*",
